sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Ada
    participant E as NGINX
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant R as Redis
    participant O as order-service
    A->>E: POST /api/v1/orders (4th in 2 s)
    E->>G: + X-Request-Id, X-Real-IP
    G->>G: JWT valid, subject ada
    G->>R: token bucket rate:checkout:user:ada
    R-->>G: denied, 0.4 tokens left
    G-->>A: 429 RATE_LIMITED, Retry-After 3
    Note over O: never called
